node_modules
# 只排除仓库根目录的 dist；完整部署包里的 web/dist 必须带进构建上下文，
# 这样 core/Dockerfile 才能复用预构建的前端产物，不用重新构建前端
/dist
.git
.gitignore
*.md
.idea
.vscode
*.log
*.tgz
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
core/data/logs/*
!core/data/logs/.gitkeep
core/data/*.json
!core/data/.gitkeep
web/node_modules
coverage
.nyc_output
*.tsbuildinfo
**/node_modules